Simplify: (\old(this.get(i)) == null && this.get(i) == null) || this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i))). But need to avoid null pointer. Use (this.get(i) == null ? \old(this.get(i)) == null : this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i)))).

Thus assert statement: assert (index >=0 && index < \old(this.size())) => \forall int i; 0 <= i && i < index; (this.get(i) == null ? \old(this.get(i)) == null : this.get(i).equals(\old(this.get(i))));

